{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":5,"exerciseID":"076d3d0proQkt5jMOWr","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":9,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"九年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1) ${\\mathrm k}_1=\\frac14\\mathrm n^2+2n+4$ ; ${\\mathrm k}_2=-\\mathrm n^2+2n+9$ (2)见解析(3) $\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{46}}5$ 或 $\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{46}}5$ 或 $\\frac{-1+2\\sqrt{142}}{21}$ 或 $\\frac{-1-2\\sqrt{142}}{21}$ ","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5dfb10fc282fce673fc155cd","queId":"076d3d0proQkt5jMOWr","schCode":"3035","textbookId":"5dfada3c0248369c447d5ac8"}],"question":"在平面直角坐标系中，抛物线y<sub>1</sub>=-(x+4)(x-m)与x轴交于点A和点B(n,0)(n≥-4)，顶点坐标记为(h<sub>1</sub>,k<sub>1</sub>).抛物线y<sub>2</sub>=-(x+2n)<sup>2</sup>-n<sup>2</sup>+2n+9的顶点坐标记为(h<sub>2</sub>,k<sub>2</sub>).<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cabe5f1000q.png\">(1)求k<sub>1</sub>，k<sub>2</sub>的值（用含n的代数式表示）；(2)当-4≤n≤4时，探究k<sub>1</sub>与k<sub>2</sub>的大小关系;(3)经过点M(2n+9,-5n<sup>2</sup>)和点N(2n,9-5n<sup>2</sup>)的直线与抛物线y<sub>1</sub>=-(x+4)(x-n),y<sub>2</sub>=-(x+2n)<sup>2</sup>-n<sup>2</sup>+2n+9的公共点恰好为3个不同点时，请直接写出n的值.","solution":"(1)y<sub>1</sub>＝－(x－4)(x－n)＝－x<sup>2</sup>＋(n－4)x＋4n，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814caefdfb000r.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814caf14e6000x.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814caf2fb6000t.png\">(2)<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814caf5e9d000s.png\">①当<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cafa2e1000y.png\">时，可得n＞2或n＜－2，即当－4≤n＜－2或2＜n≤4时，k<sub>1</sub>＞k<sub>2</sub>；②当<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cb02c0d000u.png\">时，可得－2＜n＜2， 即当－2＜n＜2时，k<sub>1</sub>＜k<sub>2</sub>；③当<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cb0693b000t.png\">可得n＝2或n＝－2，即当n＝2或n＝－2时，k<sub>1</sub>＝k<sub>2</sub>；(3)n的值为<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cb0b438000z.png\">或<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cb0d2c4000v.png\">或<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cb10055000u.png\">或<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1814cb11df50010.png\">","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ece2610518ec3c65e1e94bd","knowName":"已知抛物线与直线的交点情况求参数的取值范围","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"076d3d0proQkt5jMOWr","sortIndex":530}]}